BIB                 15        100
TITLE      Measurement and analysis of the 241Am neutron capture
            cross section at the nTOF facility at CERN
AUTHOR     (E.Mendoza, D.Cano-Ott, S.Altstadt, S.Andriamonje,
            J.Andrzejewski, L.Audouin, J.Balibrea, V.Becares,
